## III. Synthesis Spec (Output of Reconnaissance)

### Baseline Validation Layer
- **20 dimensions operationalized** with borrowed datasets
- **Feedback loop mapping** with scientific justification (evidence + uncertainty)
- **Data quality matrix** showing coverage by epoch/region
- **Confidence tiers** for all claims

### Novel Territory Map
- **Conceptual gaps** (unsolved problems in Spengler/Wallerstein/cybernetics literature)
- **Measurement gaps** (dimensions lacking data; candidate new indicators)
- **Anomaly catalog** (historical cases where theory diverged from expectation)
- **Discovery vectors**: Why each gap matters for macro-cybernetic understanding

### Phased Implementation Roadmap
- **Phase 1 (Dashboard MVP)**: Validate baseline on high-confidence dimensions + established feedback loops
- **Phase 2 (Model Enrichment)**: Add medium-confidence dimensions + new indicators for novel territory
- **Phase 3 (Critique Engine)**: Integrate anomaly analysis + counterfactual sandbox
- **Phase 4 (Meta-Learning)**: Automated model updating + feedback loop re-weighting

